      "pins": ["FCC1.48", "FCC1.73", "UART3_FCC1.3", "UART3_FCC1.4"],
      "nets": ["UART3_RX_FCC", "UART3_TX_FCC"],
      "observed": "The STM32H753 VCAP pins are connected directly to the UART3 connector nets: pin 73 to UART3_RX_FCC and pin 48 to UART3_TX_FCC.",
      "expected": "VCAP pins should have the required local bypass capacitors and must not be used as UART signals. UART3 signals should connect to appropriate MCU UART I/O pins.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"146\") (name \"UART3_RX_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"73\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\"))"
